IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BTXNQRY.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT TXN-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-TXN-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS TXN-ID
        FILE STATUS IS WS-TXN-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD TXN-FILE.
01 TXN-REC.
   COPY "BTXREC".

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TXN-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-TXN-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).
01 WS-AMT-ED PIC -(15)9.99.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-OP PIC X(08).
01 LS-ID PIC X(12).
01 BK-TXN-REC.
   COPY "BTXREC".
01 LS-RC PIC X(02).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-OP LS-ID BK-TXN-REC LS-RC.
    MOVE "00" TO LS-RC
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-TXN-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/txn.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-TXN-PATH
    OPEN INPUT TXN-FILE
    IF WS-TXN-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "35" TO LS-RC
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    EVALUATE LS-OP
        WHEN "GET" PERFORM DO-GET
        WHEN "LIST" PERFORM DO-LIST
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "99" TO LS-RC
    END-EVALUATE
    CLOSE TXN-FILE
    GOBACK.

DO-GET.
    MOVE LS-ID TO TXN-ID OF TXN-REC
    READ TXN-FILE
    IF WS-TXN-ST = "00"
        MOVE TXN-REC TO BK-TXN-REC
        MOVE "00" TO LS-RC
    ELSE
        MOVE "23" TO LS-RC
    END-IF.

DO-LIST.
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ TXN-FILE NEXT RECORD
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM SHOW-ONE
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM.

SHOW-ONE.
    MOVE TXN-AMOUNT OF TXN-REC TO WS-AMT-ED
    DISPLAY "id=" FUNCTION TRIM(TXN-ID OF TXN-REC)
        " status=" TXN-STATUS OF TXN-REC
        " type=" FUNCTION TRIM(TXN-TYPE OF TXN-REC)
        " amount=" WS-AMT-ED
        " currency=" FUNCTION TRIM(TXN-CURRENCY OF TXN-REC)
        " src=" FUNCTION TRIM(TXN-SRC OF TXN-REC)
        " dst=" FUNCTION TRIM(TXN-DST OF TXN-REC)
        " created=" TXN-CREATED OF TXN-REC.
